Clone/tests/profile-host-reviews.spec.ts`\n\n---\n\n## Key Implementation Details\n\n### **Submit Button Enabled/Disabled State Logic**\n\nFrom `ReviewForm.tsx` (lines 33-35, 95):\n```typescript\nconst allUnset = Object.values(ratings).every(v => v === 0)\nconst anyUnset = Object.values(ratings).some(v => v === 0)\n\n// Button disabled when:\ndisabled={submitting || allUnset}\n```\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Button is **DISABLED** when: all ratings are unset (all zeros) OR submitting is true\n- Button is **ENABLED** only after at least one rating is set (not all zeros)\n- Even with one rating set, form validation on submit (line 41-43) requires ALL ratings to be set\n- If incomplete, validation error displays: \"Please rate all categories\"\n\n### **Form Component Structure**\n\n`ReviewForm.tsx` contains:\n1. **RatingSliders component** - 6 rating categories (Overall, Cleanliness, Accuracy, Communication, Location, Value)\n2. **Comment textarea** - `data-testid=\"review-comment-textarea\"` (optional)\n3. **Submit button** - `data-testid=\"submit-review-button\"` (disabled logic at line 95)\n4. **Cancel button** - `data-testid=\"cancel-review-button\"`\n\n### **Review Listing on Profile Page**\n\nFrom `UserReviewsList.tsx`:\n- Fetched via `fetchUserReviews(guestId)` from `userReviewsSlice.ts` (line 34)\n- API call: `GET /api/reviews?guest_id=${guestId}`\n- Each review card displays:\n  - Property title (clickable link to property detail)\n  - Star rating visualization\n  - Comment text\n  - Formatted creation date\n\n### **API Review Submission**\n\nFrom `reviews.ts` (POST handler, lines 38-73):\n```typescript\nPOST /api/reviews\nBody includes:\n- booking_id, property_id, guest_id (required)\n- rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value (required)\n- comment (optional)\n- created_at (optional, defaults to current ISO timestamp)\n```\n\n**Validation:**\n- Returns 409 if review already exists for booking\n- Returns 201 on successful creation\n- Returns 400 on missing required fields\n\n### **Reviews on Property Detail Page**\n\nFrom `ReviewsSection.tsx`:\n- Displays all reviews for a property\n- Shows average ratings for each category\n- Displays guest name, avatar, date, rating, and comment\n- Initial display limit: 6 reviews with \"Show all\" toggle\n\n---\n\n**All file paths are absolute and ready for reference.**"}],"totalDurationMs":21596,"totalTokens":42772,"totalToolUseCount":20,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1327,"cache_read_input_tokens":40357,"output_tokens":1081,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1327},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
