[2026-03-15T00:35:57.264Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WVwALRazffeibALBoAXEBt","type":"tool_result","content":"1091:<!-- Components: ProfileForm, BecomeHostButton, UserReviewsList -->\n1150:### Component: BecomeHostButton\n1152:#### Test: Become a Host button is visible for non-host users\n1155:- **Expected:** A \"Become a Host\" button is visible on the profile page.\n1157:#### Test: Become a Host button is hidden for existing hosts\n1160:- **Expected:** The \"Become a Host\" button is NOT visible on the profile page.\n1162:#### Test: Clicking Become a Host sets user as host\n1164:- **Action:** User clicks the \"Become a Host\" button.\n1165:- **Expected:** A confirmation dialog appears (e.g., \"Are you sure you want to become a host?\"). User confirms. A `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` request is sent. Upon success, the button disappears, a success message is shown (e.g., \"You are now a host!\"), and the Redux user state updates `is_host` to `true`. The \"Hosting\" link becomes available in the navigation sidebar.\n1167:#### Test: Cancel Become a Host confirmation dialog\n1168:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`. The \"Become a Host\" button is visible.\n1169:- **Action:** User clicks the \"Become a Host\" button, then clicks \"Cancel\" in the confirmation dialog.\n1170:- **Expected:** The dialog closes. No API call is made. The \"Become a Host\" button remains visible. `is_host` remains `false`.\n1172:#### Test: Become a Host button appearance\n1175:- **Expected:** The \"Become a Host\" button is styled with the coral/red accent color (#FF5A5F), has clear text reading \"Become a Host\", and is visually prominent on the page."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7da53361-7b7a-4448-be86-193d39a038b9","uuid":"84afd47c-3cc9-48d9-8bcd-04df2625e599","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"1091:<!-- Components: ProfileForm, Becom