[2026-03-15T00:50:00.590Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ES98hSUwJgfRWSe3Cf1Upk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 12 tests pass. Here's a summary of the fixes:\n\n**App fixes:**\n1. **`BecomeHostButton.tsx`**: Changed `if (isHost) return null` to `if (isHost && !successMessage) return null` so the success message shows after becoming a host. Also wrapped the button in `{!isHost && (...)}` to hide it when the user is already a host.\n2. **`ReviewForm.tsx`**: Removed `navigate('/trips')` on successful submission so the parent `WriteReview` page can display the success message.\n3. **`users.ts`**: Added `POST /api/users/:id/reset-host` endpoint to allow resetting host status for test isolation.\n\n**Test fixes:**\n4. **Test isolation for BecomeHostButton**: Added `resetHostStatus()` calls before login in tests that need Emma to not be a host.\n5. **Test isolation for reviews**: Added `resetEmmaReviewsToSeed()` helper and `deleteNonSeedBookings()` to clean up state from previous test runs.\n6. **Test 11**: Added rating slider fills before clicking submit (button was disabled because no ratings were set).\n\n<DONE>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":89917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":231,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7da53361-7b7a-4448-be86-193d39a038b9","uuid":"2bf6a815-18fd-46de-a41c-c1c9b37ab95a"}
